---
description: Use ASCII hyphens instead of em-dashes or en-dashes
alwaysApply: true
---

# No em-dash or en-dash

Never use em-dashes (`—`, U+2014) or en-dashes (`–`, U+2013) in code, UI copy, comments, or docs.

Always use a regular ASCII hyphen (`-`) instead.

## Examples

```dart
// ✅
value.isEmpty ? '-' : value

// ❌
value.isEmpty ? '—' : value
```
